    "_comment": "A copy of META-INF/native-image/reflect-config.json shipped inside h2-2.3.232.jar, without the three java.awt entries. H2 registers java.awt.Desktop under the condition that org.h2.tools.Server is reachable, which it is through the AUTO_SERVER support in org.h2.engine.Database.startServer. That single registration pulls the whole java.desktop module into the image - about 2200 methods, 1.6 MB of code and six shared libraries beside the executable - although this application opens no browser and shows no tray icon. The original file is excluded by --exclude-config in run-ujorm-petstore-native.sh; refresh this copy when H2 is upgraded. Dropped: java.awt.Desktop, java.awt.SystemTray, java.awt.TrayIcon",
